{"mode":"words","text":"Denne ord-for-ord-oversættelse kaldes afkodning. Den lyder bevidst klodset — for netop sådan kan du se, hvordan sproget virkelig er opbygget, helt uden at skulle lære grammatikregler udenad. Før i tiden brugte man timevis på at gøre det manuelt med en ordbog. I LinguaFlow klarer appen dette trin fuldstændigt for dig – for enhver tekst, du vil lære.","words":[{"s":0,"e":406},{"s":522,"e":1707},{"s":1753,"e":2043},{"s":2125,"e":2833},{"s":3158,"e":3320},{"s":3367,"e":3599},{"s":3646,"e":4029},{"s":4110,"e":4516},{"s":4632,"e":4923},{"s":5248,"e":5375},{"s":5422,"e":5654},{"s":5712,"e":5968},{"s":6060,"e":6188},{"s":6211,"e":6374},{"s":6467,"e":6769},{"s":6803,"e":7163},{"s":7245,"e":7767},{"s":7825,"e":8162},{"s":8185,"e":8266},{"s":8324,"e":8963},{"s":9346,"e":9578},{"s":9636,"e":9868},{"s":9938,"e":9985},{"s":10008,"e":10379},{"s":10426,"e":10751},{"s":10820,"e":11761},{"s":11819,"e":12457},{"s":13154,"e":13456},{"s":13549,"e":13595},{"s":13653,"e":14002},{"s":14095,"e":14408},{"s":14431,"e":14571},{"s":14629,"e":15255},{"s":15348,"e":15464},{"s":15511,"e":15557},{"s":15581,"e":15790},{"s":15813,"e":15906},{"s":15940,"e":16393},{"s":16475,"e":16625},{"s":16649,"e":16718},{"s":16834,"e":17369},{"s":18321,"e":18402},{"s":18471,"e":19075},{"s":19145,"e":19516},{"s":19598,"e":19853},{"s":19888,"e":20108},{"s":20155,"e":20364},{"s":20445,"e":21049},{"s":21084,"e":21235},{"s":21269,"e":21525},{"s":21676,"e":21920},{"s":22245,"e":22396},{"s":22430,"e":22744},{"s":22825,"e":23417},{"s":23533,"e":23649},{"s":23696,"e":23824},{"s":23870,"e":24520}]}